{"c":[{"name":"20261022T001048Z-3d45bd43ac82702b","text":"uv --with from a 2.0.0 overlay selects VERSION when the project env lacks it, VIRTUAL_ENV set or not. Unsetting VIRTUAL_ENV is not why. --project --with 1.5.4 reuses the project venv while it is 1.5.4. A missing version exits 1.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T010333Z-400a0f0e43cfc736","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 rejects the deprecated SQL lambda arrow (list_transform(l, x -> ...)) with BinderException; write lambda x: ... instead, which 1.5.4 also accepts. Engine SQL has no arrow lambdas (checked 2026-10-21).","type":"note"}]}
